Z||000000||BOILERMAKER||12-06-2000||08:09 PM||||Honestly the paint job turned out fabulous.  I was kinda disappointed with the pictures though.  O well, guess y'all will have to see it in person this upcoming spring/summer.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/doneout.jpg"> <P>Here is the back.  It's an acquired taste I think.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/inback.jpg"> <P>Here is where the mustang scoop SHOULD be.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/inscp.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/outscp.jpg"> <P>I also have the side scoops, but didn't want to take up more space than necessary.  Let me know if anybody wants to see more of my work.||||reg||14
