Z||000011||BOILERMAKER||12-07-2000||06:19 PM||||Scott, you are too kind, but you could have done the exact same job if you had the time and resources to do it.  I really did nothing extravagant, just nice enough for me.  I wanted something to put into the show next year, and I think I have it now.<P>Anyway, I will send more pics via email (don't want it to take an hour to upload this thread) to those who express interest.  I have a lot of them, so if I don't send enough, please don't hesitate to ask for more.<P>Armando - As long as it took to put that scoop on the front hood, it had better be functional.  Actually, there is a sort of long story behind it, but I made it so it would help with heat, but in the end didn't NEED it and have it anyway.<P>Whenever you are up, let me know and we will meet sometime.<p>[This message has been edited by BOILERMAKER (edited 12-07-2000).]||||reg||1
